      "F-002": {
        "value": {
          "text": "Nai Pepea: Employee: Employee redirected to citizen login, signed out, after first password update",
          "issue": "#66",
          "tab": "CMS 2.20.1 Features",
          "area": "Employee",
          "details": "A newly signed up employee completed the password update. After the update, the page redirected to the ke-nairobi DIGIT UI login page (`/ke-nairobi/digit-ui/citizen/login`) and the employee was signed out.\nActual: After the password update, the employee is redirected to the citizen login page (`/ke-nairobi/digit-ui/citizen/login`) in a signed-out state, instead of remaining signed in.\nPage: https://naipepea.digit.org/ke-nairobi/digit-ui/citizen/login",
          "source": "bug-reporter",
          "url": "https://github.com/egovernments/complaint-management-system/issues/66",
          "state": "open",
          "caseId": "",
          "by": "Gurjeet Singh",
          "at": "2026-11-20 12:22"
        },
        "updated": "2026-11-20 12:22",
        "by": "Gurjeet Singh"
      },
      "F-003": {
        "value": {
          "text": "Nai Pepea: Employee: Back to Application after repeat password reset lands on login page",
          "issue": "#67",
          "tab": "CMS 2.20.1 Features",
          "area": "Employee",
          "details": "After completing a password setup/reset, the user's session stayed signed in. A second password reset was then started in the same browser window. Clicking \"Back to Application\" on the Keycloak UPDATE_PASSWORD flow navigates to the login page (`/configurator/login`, \"Sign in to your account\" with a \"Log in\" button).\n\nNote: the user is still signed in at this point, yet the application shows the login screen, which suggests they need to log in again.\nActual: \"Back to Application\" navigates to the login page (`/configurator/login`) even though the user's session is still signed in. This can make the user think they must log in again.\nExpected: \"Back to Application\" should redirect to the tenant selection page, which has a sign out option, so the user is not confused into thinking they need to log in again.\nPage: https://naipepea.digit.org/auth/realms/KE/login-actions/required-action?execution=UPDATE_PASSWORD&client_id=digit-identity-bff&tab_id=nr5X6JPbgQI&client_data=eyJydSI6Imh0dHBzOi8vbmFpcGVwZWEuZGlnaXQub3JnL2lkZW50aXR5L3YxL3Bhc3N3b3JkL3NldHVwLWNvbXBsZXRlL1lVU2Y2X0lKdWI1M0t1OGR3MFpGNE9TdFEzS0RwYmlMdmZQZ3",
          "source": "bug-reporter",
          "url": "https://github.com/egovernments/complaint-management-system/issues/67",
          "state": "open",
          "caseId": "",
          "by": "Gurjeet Singh",
          "at": "2026-11-20 12:34"
        },
        "updated": "2026-11-20 12:34",
